domain AwarenessRepair:
  description "Correct explicit output guidance and physical-response accounting under owner authorization."
evidence OWNER:
  "Owner asked to implement the proposed response-format and waiting-reservation repair. No new paid trial is requested."
evidence SHAPE:
  "Observed runtime rejected reflexDesires[0].action as string. Existing prompt says preserve offered structure but availableActions uses a different schema from CharacterActionIntentSchema."
evidence ACCOUNTING:
  "All five SDK attempts completed; execution failure handlers always settle physicalClosed=false and factory loses physical completion on schema error."
evidence NARRATION:
  "The narration worker similarly ignores rejected physical promises in late receipt handling and sets physicalFinished only after provider validation success; postresponse schema failure loses completion evidence."
evidence CLOCK:
  "A subsequent offline happy run recorded updatedAt earlier than runtime startedAt and failed the existing world-commit backwards-clock guard. Host clock cause is unknown. Stabilize test fixture elapsed Date.now with monotonic time; leave production guard unchanged."
premise CAUSE:
  "The failure handler deterministically retains slots on postresponse validation rejection. Missing exact output guidance is confirmed but its contribution to this model response is not proven without raw output."
premise UNKNOWN:
  "Transport rejection or timeout does not confirm provider completion. Unknown cost must stay unknown even when physical completion is known."
premise ALTERNATIVES:
  "Marking all thrown calls closed would wrongly release timeout slots. Relaxing authoritative action schema would change accepted semantics. Another paid trial alone would not repair deterministic accounting."
decision FIX based_on OWNER, SHAPE, ACCOUNTING, NARRATION, CLOCK, CAUSE, UNKNOWN, ALTERNATIVES:
  "Keep authoritative outputs strict. Add compact prose output contract as awareness-prompt-v2 for new battles and retain awareness-prompt-v1 routing for existing bindings. Carry invocation-local observed physical completion across schema/JSON failure as a narrow typed error; release physical slot only on observed complete response, retain unknown cost, discard late canonical results. Verify success, invalid output, timeout, late completion, concurrent role isolation and immutable prompt routing offline."
